<title>UK: Waverley says jobs at Monktonhall need to go.</title>
<headline>Waverley says jobs at Monktonhall need to go.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British mining group Waverley Mining Finance said on Thursday it would have to make redundant all the workers at its flood-hit Monktonhall Colliery.</p>
<p>Waverley said it had taken the decision after consultation with a provisional liquidator for the mine and the Coal Authority.</p>
